  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "Find $\\int \u27e84{csc}^{2}\u2061t,\\,3{e}^{3t}\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t.$",
  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \u27e84{csc}^{2}\u2061t,\\,3{e}^{3t}\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8\\int 4{csc}^{2}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 3{e}^{3t}\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-4\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{3t}+{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-4\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t,\\,{e}^{3t}\u27e9+\u27e8{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8-4\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t,\\,{e}^{3t}\u27e9+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
